y. It will provide the user with the name of the city if he-or-she fails to correctly guess it, and will ask the user if he-or-she would like to play the game again.","topics":[],"score":227423,"global_rank":119227},{"name":"wliang25/sillygoose","owner":"wliang25","html_url":"https://github.com/wliang25/sillygoose","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227423,"global_rank":119228},{"name":"rkamradt/scotchthighui","owner":"rkamradt","html_url":"https://github.com/rkamradt/scotchthighui","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"An app to pair single malt scotches and chicken thighs","topics":[],"score":227423,"global_rank":119235},{"name":"merikettapearl212/note_taker","owner":"merikettapearl212","html_url":"https://github.com/merikettapearl212/note_taker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Create an application that can be used to write, save, and delete notes. This application will use an express backend and save and retrieve note data from a JSON file.","topics":[],"score":227423,"global_rank":119236},{"name":"myerstina515/auth-api","owner":"myerstina515","html_url":"https://github.com/myerstina515/auth-api","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227423,"global_rank":119237},{"name":"umamahesh51/debounceandthrottling","owner":"umamahesh51","html_url":"https://github.com/umamahesh51/debounceandthrottling","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227423,"global_rank":119244},{"name":"mfallesen/date-planner-api","owner":"mfallesen","html_url":"https://github.com/mfallesen/date-planner-api","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227423,"global_rank":119246},{"name":"btbacker/eajournal-frontend","owner":"btbacker","